{"id":1020804,"name":"자스민·심문 IV","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"자스민·심문 IV","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1020804]}],"trial":{"trial_id":20804,"stage":"4단계","unlock_time":"2026-06-25 14:00:00","diary1":"니르바나 항을 떠난 후 당신은 MBCC로 급히 이송되어 응급처치를 받았다. 하지만 이동 중 시간이 많이 지체된 탓에 상태가 좋지 않다…","diary2":"마침내 '축제'의 막이 내리며 고향을 잃은 자들의 꿈속에서 오래도록 타오르던 불꽃이 영면에 들고, 자스민은 다시 춤을 추기 시작했다. 이번 춤에서는 칼을 휘두르지 않았다.\n　　'먼 곳의 친구여… 다음 해도 부디 다시 만날 수 있기를. 곧 다가올 축제에서, 당신과 반드시 다시 만날 수 있기를.'","evidence":[{"ID":260917,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260918,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":3,"dialogue_id":120804007,"next":[8]},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120804023,"next":null},{"step":24,